  "definition": "Renewing Device Licenses",
  "effectiveDate": "2017-12-01",
  "historyNote": "#9639, eff 1-20-10; ss by #10976, eff 11-20-15; ss by #12424, eff 12-1-17 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Agr 1400)",
